@startuml
title 광고 배너 우선순위 시스템 시퀀스 다이어그램

participant BannerService
database DB

BannerService -> DB : SELECT * FROM banners\nWHERE is_active = true\nAND start_date <= NOW()\nAND end_date >= NOW()
DB --> BannerService : 활성 배너 목록

loop 각 배너별로
    BannerService -> DB : SELECT click_count, view_count\nFROM banners WHERE banner_id = ?
    DB --> BannerService : 클릭/조회 수
    BannerService -> BannerService : calculatePriorityScore(advertisingCost, clickRate)
    BannerService -> DB : UPDATE banners\nSET priority = ? WHERE banner_id = ?
end

BannerService -> DB : SELECT * FROM banners\nWHERE is_active = true\nORDER BY priority DESC LIMIT 5
DB --> BannerService : 상위 5개 배너

@enduml